  "verify_run": {
    "status": "completed",
    "answer": "**Found:** Summit Card credited the full $95 annual fee, and Northwind posted the full $180.77 jacket refund. I recorded both as received against their cases.\n\n**St Mary:** The $5,996.01 self-pay bill may qualify for financial assistance. I tried to request an itemized bill and application through the listed billing page, but the proposal tool returned \u201cWork not found\u201d for the existing case ID. Nothing was sent; I saved that blocker on the case. The charity care application also needs your household size and current annual household income; there\u2019s already an open question for those facts.\n\nThe June Keystone EOB is a separate $1,364.87 denial. Its appeal deadline is December 27, 2026, and it remains open. The review status now shows no unread records or unsaved leads.",
    "committed_micros": 16712
